{"reviews":[{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-0","r":4.0,"t":"Product came on time and looks just like the picture","x":"Product came on time and looks just like the picture. The only issue I had was it was difficult to get them in your hair without the spring part showing. Used them for my daugthers 8th Birthday.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-1","r":5.0,"t":"Looked beautiful, worked great!","x":"These worked perfectly. They looked beautiful against my daughters dark hair and the stayed in with no problems. Great quality as well. I wild highly recommend them.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-2","r":5.0,"t":"A turn (spin?) for the better","x":"I was maid-of-honor / hairdresser for my sister at her wedding. I used these and did a dual faux-waterfall-braid; the flowers looked absolutely PERFECT. The white acrylic was clearly high quality, and added a touch of class and elegance. (Picture of one side attached. Both sides were (theoretically) the same.)  Pros: 1) GORGEOUS 2) easy to use 3) stayed in reasonably well (I used too much hairspray, and that helped)  The only downsides were 1) (as with ANY hair-spin) that they occasionally get a","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-3","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to wear and elegant","x":"They look gorgeous on my daughter's hair. Easy to wear and elegant.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-4","r":5.0,"t":"Arrived broken","x":"These are great twists but two of eight arrived broken. They come in only a ziplock bag, not their own box, and apparently Amazon thought it would be great to stash them in a big box with other hard things and just a little bit of air padding. Five stars for the twists, just... make sure you order them alone in a separate order, or only with soft stuff, I guess.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-5","r":4.0,"t":"... daughter use for a firts communion and she looks wonderful, but Them fall down several time","x":"My daughter use for a firts communion and she looks wonderful, but Them fall down several time.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-6","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful, practical, and elegant!","x":"These were so beautiful I got a second set! I used these in my hair on my wedding day, and even my hair stylist was boasting about how beautiful they were and how they were the nicest she'd seen. I love that they twist into your hair. Ensures that they stay, versus bobby pin style which always fall out of my hair. Certain parts of my hair were too slippery for them to stay put. Particularly my bangs when they were just smooth. They can slide down if your hair is really slippery. but most of mine","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-7","r":5.0,"t":"These were a beautiful addition to my updo for my wedding","x":"These were a beautiful addition to my updo for my wedding! I loved how easy they were to put in, and they stayed put better than expected. (If you do have any problems with them coming loose, you can anchor them down with a bobby pin.) Got lots of compliments from our guests and my husband absolutely loved the simple yet elegant touch :)","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-8","r":4.0,"t":"Dainty and beautiful","x":"Very dainty and pretty. I wore them in my hair for my daughter's wedding. I gave them three stars because they were very difficult to remove and broke of easily. These are perfect for a single use and would be perfect for a bride, junior bridesmaid or flower girl.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-9","r":5.0,"t":"Look very classy and delicate","x":"Love the tiny sparkles and the delicate look. After I saw the reviews of clients using them for little girls, I was a bit skeptical to put them in my hair for the wedding. They look amazing in my hair. Will post some pictures after the wedding :)","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-10","r":5.0,"t":"Arrived quickly ,for beautiful hair deco","x":"Very pretty Upon arrival two petals on the twists were broken off I tried to crazy and e6000 glue them back on but they stayed broken These screw ins however are very very pretty","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-11","r":5.0,"t":"Very Pretty","x":"Used them for wedding event. Received a lot of compliments! They are very cute, but need to secure with an additional hair pin so they will not slip off.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-12","r":5.0,"t":"but they looked great in my hair at my recent wedding","x":"Very cute hair accessories!  Would have loves it if they were a little bit larger, but they looked great in my hair at my recent wedding.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-13","r":5.0,"t":"Coiffure Flower Crystals \ud83c\udf38","x":"[[VIDEOID:5115a41ed1d8cf91fec2e0f52de624b3]] The pictures and descriptions do not do these flowery hair crystals justice! They are so very pretty, and the petals have a transparent effect, and even have some sparkles at the base of the petals that shine through with the light and through the transparent resin material. These are so very pretty, and will make a perfect addition to any wedding outfit.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-14","r":5.0,"t":"I should of purchased more. Love them !","x":"My horse was in my best friends wedding and I used these in his braided tail and mane with tinsel. The results was fabulous. The only regret, I wish I would of purchases more. I had 6 boxes for 2 horses and I wish I had 6 boxes for 1 horse.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-15","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap, 2 broke before I even got to use them","x":"I was going to use these for my wedding hair, but 2 of them broke as I was having my hair trial done. Complete waste of money and I didn't even get to use them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-16","r":5.0,"t":"Very Pretty and Good Quality","x":"These are LOVELY! Wearing them in my hair for my wedding and I am so excited. Such an amazing price for these and they are gorgeous!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-17","r":5.0,"t":"Looked beautiful","x":"Looked beautiful for prom. The spiral coil was a little difficult to navigate at first, but they did stay in well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-18","r":5.0,"t":"Much cuter than it looks","x":"These are high quality plastics. Looks great in braided messy hair. Great for pictures of any kind.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I used them in my cousin's hair for her wedding and they looked so cute and jazzed it up","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-20","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Very pretty. A little smaller than expected but we're perfect for our needs.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I'm greatly satisfied with this purchase. Perfection condition .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-22","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Pretty, but they were a little hard to put in and take out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"The items were beautiful and just as the seller described.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B09DXK7BB3-24","r":5.0,"t":"Very shiny! I love it!!","x":"I love it!! Super cute! It\u2019ll be perfect for my wedding!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the twists as beautiful, pretty, or elegant, especially for weddings and special occasions.","cites":[2,3,4,7,8,9,10,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the twists are easy to put in and stay in place well, though some note they can slip or fall out and may need an extra hair pin.","cites":[2,6,7,8,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report receiving broken or damaged pieces on arrival, sometimes due to packaging.","cites":[5,9,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the twists difficult to insert or remove, with the spring part showing or pieces breaking during removal.","cites":[1,9]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the quality and delicate, classy look, with some wishing they were larger or ordering more.","cites":[3,10,13,15]}]},"qa":[]}